(text "JP2 OPEN and output harness absent for initial validation.\nU10/J9 marked DNP in this review assembly.\nOne control channel is reserved for the shared MOS requested for two modules.\nOutput pin numbers are logical +/- only; no connector or current rating is frozen." (at 20.32 231.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.651 1.651)) (justify left top)) (uuid 182d06c2-1b56-5528-a868-fe10cc191ef4))
(text "Firmware: GPIO21, single action <= 5 s; cooldown >= elapsed software ON time.\nThese are software rules, NOT thermal protection or physical stop evidence.\nR9 value, protection, input current, cut-off and EMC remain unresolved.\nPWR_FLAG is an ERC declaration for the optional supply, not a populated link." (at 223.52 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.651 1.651)) (justify left top)) (uuid 23f6beac-4526-57a1-b9fb-80db44160266))
)
